            <Placemark id="290">
                <name>3.00in hail 5 SW Rio Rico (10/22 2235Z) - Confirmed: measured</name>
                <description>Basis: Confirmed: measured
CoCoRaHS spotter reported 1.5-2.0 inch hail with a few hail stones measuring 3 inches. (TWC)
SPC filtered hail 261022 (3.00" 5 SW Rio Rico 2235Z) = IEM/NWS LSR HAIL 3.00 M (Public/CoCoRaHS, NWS Tucson). Supported by MRMS MESH 2.66" swath ~2.5 mi S of the report, 1.75" E "golf ball sized hail in Rio Rico" (1 S Rio Rico 2245Z), 1.50" M trained spotter 5 SW Rio Rico, NWS Tucson golf-ball-hail warning for Rio Rico/Nogales/Tubac; HailTrace public 10/22 page lists the same report.</description>
                <Point id="289">
                    <coordinates>-111.04,31.44,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
