SPC filtered hail 261022 (3.00" 5 N Page Springs 1636Z) = IEM/NWS LSR HAIL 3.00 M (Public, via NWS Flagstaff X page). Public X photo (west side of Sedona, 17:08Z) shows a stone wider than an iPhone; 1.00" E 4 SW West Sedona 1633Z. DISCREPANCY: MRMS MESH max at the report point only 0.16" - no 2"+ MESH swath here (terrain/beam blockage likely); kept on the ground report.</description>
